 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental service
+
+`createRentalService()` from `src/index.ts` creates an in-memory equipment catalogue and booking
+service. Add boards or sails with `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })`, where `dailyPrice` is a
+non-negative integer number of euro cents. `quote({ itemId, start, end })` returns the total in cents;
+`book(...)` creates a booking with a service-generated id and rejects periods overlapping an existing
+booking for that item.
+
+Rental dates must be ISO-8601 UTC midnights (`Z` or `+00:00`). `start` is the first rented day and
+`end` is midnight after the last rented day, so the period is one or more whole days. The service does
+not yet provide cancellation operations; the future cancellation policy is full refund at least 24
+hours before start, and no refund when cancelled less than 24 hours before start.
