+---
+id: dl-001-preserve-rental-cancellation-refund-policy
+type: decision-log
+title: "Preserve rental cancellation refund policy"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+The rental module's initial scope excludes cancellation operations. When cancellation is implemented, a booking cancelled at least 24 hours before its start receives a full refund; a cancellation less than 24 hours before start receives no refund. This rule is retained as product policy so later work can implement it consistently.
