+
+Implement and export `createRentalService()` from `src/index.ts`. The in-memory service accepts board and sail equipment priced in integer euro cents, quotes rental periods and books equipment with unique booking identifiers. Rental periods use UTC ISO-8601 timestamps at midnight and include whole days through (but not including) the following midnight. Reject unknown equipment, invalid periods and overlapping bookings. Preserve the cancellation refund rule in project memory for future implementation; cancellations are out of scope.
